  "details": "In Groups -> Group Events\n\nThe section title marked in red should be clickable and should collapse/expand sections. Currently only the arrow icon next to it does that. When clicking the text part you can even hear the clicky sound, but nothing happens.\n\nIn all the other places like e.g. Settings or Friend Locations, the whole section name can be used to collapse/expand sections.\n\nThis is inconsistent UX.",
